{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/123867-who-here-want-abyssal-to-have-lunar-territory-infernal-geomancy-charms","id":123867,"title":"Who here want Abyssal to have Lunar Territory/Infernal Geomancy charms ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-02T10:55:01-07:00","id":123867,"title":"Who here want Abyssal to have Lunar Territory/Infernal Geomancy charms ?","content":"So, Geist from the NWoD can create Boneyard, a plasm-tained area where they do weird haunting ghost trick. I kinda wonder whether Abyssal should do that kinda of lair-making stuff or is its scope just a little too big for charms and should only be done via Sorcery ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T11:06:25-07:00","id":123879,"title":"","content":"Certainly there should be charms to create, or facilitate the creation of Shadowlands. <br /> <br /> One charm I created for this purpose was, &quot;Horror of the Haunted House,&quot; a charm that allowed the Abyssal to corrupt and twist an existing structure that he owns. <br /> <br /> For example, while standing in a mansion. The walls begin to rot and decay, the roof starts to leak, strange faces can be seen in the windows, the curtains seem to conceal human figures and the wind moans and screams. The structure is treated as a Shadowland, though only those ghosts with the express permission of the Abyssal are able to manifest in and make use of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T14:52:37-07:00","id":124015,"title":"","content":"I have the impression that sorcerous workings will obviate the great majority of effects like this, honestly, and powers of that sort often feel really inappropriate as charms -- usually this is the kind of thing you want to do once or twice, not a power you want to have on tap for 20m 1wp or whatever.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T21:19:23-07:00","id":124270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gayo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/123867-who-here-want-abyssal-to-have-lunar-territory-infernal-geomancy-charms?p=124015#post124015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have the impression that sorcerous workings will obviate the great majority of effects like this, honestly, and powers of that sort often feel really inappropriate as charms -- usually this is the kind of thing you want to do once or twice, not a power you want to have on tap for 20m 1wp or whatever.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm, Holy Land Infliction does have the Sorcerous keyword. A generic fluff-it-yourself &quot;Create Lair&quot; spell can probably satisfy those who want to be a dungeon maker.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}